Package: gnome-shell-extension-quick-command
Version: @VERSION@
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 45)
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: jarvan1 <jarvan1@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jarvan1/gnome-quick-command
Description: Quick Command launcher for GNOME Shell
 Quick Command provides application discovery and launch, pinyin search,
 configurable keyboard activation, and searchable clipboard history.
